      "block_id": "2605.00155_p48_b9",
      "text": "Baseline implementations.\nGRPO uses the proxy reward directly and converts the\ngroup of G completions for a prompt into normalized advantages by subtracting the\ngroup mean and dividing by the group standard deviation. PPO uses the same proxy\n",
