      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p48_b10",
      "text": "reward, but adds a value function and GAE with \u03bb = 0.95. The PPO critic is initialized\nfrom the same policy backbone with a value head and is trained by the VERL FSDP\n",
