      "text": "critic worker, using critic micro-batch size 1 per GPU; it is used only for value estimation\nand advantage computation, while the reward still comes from the proxy reward model.\nBoth PPO and GRPO use the clipped surrogate with clip radius 0.2, one PPO epoch\n",
